# Petty Revenge needs "power 3 or less" as it is cast and again as it resolves (CR 608.2b, the ruling). Bot1 aims it at Bot2's Demon Wall
# (3/3); Bot2 answers with Giant Growth (+3/+3), making its power 6. The target is illegal on resolution, so the spell does not resolve:
# the Wall lives and, as a spell that did not resolve, Petty Revenge is put into its owner's graveyard rather than shuffled into the library
# (the ruling): Disruptive Stormbrood is in Bot1's graveyard and the library is as small as after the draw (7).

